1
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:17,010
The rules keep changing.

2
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:25,850
I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.

3
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:36,290
Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.

4
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:44,930
I am resolved to sever this flood

5
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:51,290
so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,

6
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:55,650
from loneliness and distinction.

7
00:00:55,880 --> 00:01:00,610
One more step and you'll fall into madness.

8
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:05,610
Don't fall down.

9
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:08,810
I look towards the top.

10
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:11,450
Chase !

11
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:14,650
Refined to perfection.

12
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:20,570
Never retreat, no matter the danger.

13
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:23,610
I dare to defy the heavens !

14
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:27,450
Always overcome the obstacles,

15
00:01:27,390 --> 00:01:29,810
ignite the seas with blood,

16
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:34,250
bloom through trials and tribulations.

17
00:01:34,160 --> 00:01:38,890
Even the sharpest thorns

18
00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:43,450
will be reduced into ashes.

19
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:47,770
What is there to fear ?

20
00:01:52,520 --> 00:01:56,930
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

21
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:07,170
Above Planet Ran Yun

22
00:02:08,870 --> 00:02:11,080
I must hurry back to the Thunder Celestial Temple !

23
00:02:10,990 --> 00:02:12,430
As long as I return...

24
00:02:13,390 --> 00:02:14,670
You're not escaping !

25
00:02:38,870 --> 00:02:40,480
That damned beast

26
00:02:40,870 --> 00:02:42,510
actually dared to betray me !?

27
00:02:46,630 --> 00:02:47,510
There was

28
00:02:47,910 --> 00:02:49,680
a misunderstanding between us earlier.

29
00:02:49,590 --> 00:02:50,600
Oh ?

30
00:02:51,230 --> 00:02:52,390
A misunderstanding ?

31
00:02:57,390 --> 00:02:59,150
I'm a Thunder Celestial Messenger.

32
00:02:59,390 --> 00:03:00,590
Do you dare touch me !?

33
00:03:01,190 --> 00:03:01,910
Go.

34
00:03:04,790 --> 00:03:05,920
Thunder barrier,

35
00:03:05,670 --> 00:03:06,520
appear !

36
00:03:22,830 --> 00:03:24,550
This man exhausted his origin energy.

37
00:03:25,230 --> 00:03:26,110
Killing him

38
00:03:27,030 --> 00:03:28,870
would be as easy as flipping my hand.

39
00:03:30,910 --> 00:03:33,670
But it would be a shame to waste his Illusory Yin body...

40
00:03:40,630 --> 00:03:42,070
Open the thunder barrier

41
00:03:42,830 --> 00:03:44,470
and I will spare your life.

42
00:03:53,590 --> 00:03:54,350
Xu Mu,

43
00:03:54,990 --> 00:03:57,190
there is no irreconcilable grudge between us.

44
00:03:57,550 --> 00:03:58,590
What exactly

45
00:03:58,870 --> 00:04:00,230
do you want ?

46
00:04:13,750 --> 00:04:15,150
A restriction mark ?

47
00:04:16,430 --> 00:04:18,920
He wants me to acknowledge him as my master ?

48
00:04:18,950 --> 00:04:20,030
How arrogant !

49
00:04:24,310 --> 00:04:25,670
Pure thunder energy...

50
00:04:26,150 --> 00:04:29,440
He's indeed a high-grade material for refining a Celestial Guard.

51
00:04:31,150 --> 00:04:31,990
Follow me.

52
00:04:41,070 --> 00:04:43,400
Barren mountains
Abandoned planet

53
00:04:45,550 --> 00:04:46,630
This damn beast...

54
00:04:56,950 --> 00:04:58,270
I know what you want.

55
00:04:58,950 --> 00:05:00,710
You want me to acknowledge you as my master.

56
00:05:01,070 --> 00:05:01,870
Very well !

57
00:05:02,550 --> 00:05:04,470
But after you imprint the slave restriction,

58
00:05:04,430 --> 00:05:05,790
you must let me leave !

59
00:05:06,350 --> 00:05:07,350
Slave restriction ?

60
00:05:08,710 --> 00:05:10,550
So that's what he thought this was...

61
00:05:10,710 --> 00:05:11,550
Fine.

62
00:05:12,350 --> 00:05:13,940
If you break your promise,

63
00:05:14,110 --> 00:05:16,520
I will use the Thunder Celestial Temple's life-saving spell !

64
00:05:16,510 --> 00:05:19,350
Even if I have to exhaust my entire lifespan,

65
00:05:19,830 --> 00:05:21,750
I will burn everything down with you !

66
00:05:26,630 --> 00:05:28,990
No matter how profound this slave restriction is,

67
00:05:29,430 --> 00:05:31,590
I will be able to break it easily

68
00:05:31,710 --> 00:05:33,590
once I recover some origin energy.

69
00:05:34,150 --> 00:05:36,270
After that, I will return to the Thunder Celestial Temple

70
00:05:36,910 --> 00:05:38,150
and make sure that

71
00:05:38,630 --> 00:05:40,920
he dies without a grave !

72
00:05:46,390 --> 00:05:48,270
An artifact that targets the Origin Soul ?

73
00:05:48,630 --> 00:05:49,630
Xu Mu,

74
00:05:49,870 --> 00:05:50,830
what are you doing !?

75
00:05:51,550 --> 00:05:54,350
To make sure the slave restriction is safe,

76
00:05:54,630 --> 00:05:57,750
I need to temporarily extract your Origin Soul.

77
00:05:57,990 --> 00:05:59,580
Why do you need to extract my Origin Soul

78
00:05:59,510 --> 00:06:00,950
for an ordinary slave restriction !?

79
00:06:01,310 --> 00:06:02,230
Could it be you...

80
00:06:02,590 --> 00:06:04,990
Are you really refining my body into a puppet !?

81
00:06:06,310 --> 00:06:07,110
Bastard,

82
00:06:07,390 --> 00:06:08,800
give me my body back !

83
00:06:25,310 --> 00:06:27,720
10 days later

84
00:06:37,470 --> 00:06:38,670
Silver grade !

85
00:06:42,470 --> 00:06:43,510
Xu Mu,

86
00:06:43,790 --> 00:06:45,430
you tricked me !

87
00:06:45,430 --> 00:06:47,190
You thought you were clever

88
00:06:47,230 --> 00:06:48,910
and assumed it was a slave restriction.

89
00:06:52,590 --> 00:06:53,560
Fine...

90
00:06:53,870 --> 00:06:54,760
Fine !

91
00:06:55,430 --> 00:06:56,790
I admit defeat.

92
00:06:58,110 --> 00:07:00,350
But if my Origin Soul is unwilling,

93
00:07:00,870 --> 00:07:02,670
the puppet will be difficult to control.

94
00:07:02,990 --> 00:07:04,110
At worst,

95
00:07:04,390 --> 00:07:05,880
both my body and my soul

96
00:07:05,670 --> 00:07:07,110
will be destroyed !

97
00:07:10,470 --> 00:07:12,510
You will be my puppet for 3000 years.

98
00:07:12,830 --> 00:07:13,990
After that,

99
00:07:14,510 --> 00:07:16,030
you will be free.

100
00:07:16,830 --> 00:07:17,880
What do you think ?

101
00:07:21,190 --> 00:07:22,430
This sword energy...

102
00:07:23,110 --> 00:07:25,990
Even if I use my lifespan and the life-saving spell,

103
00:07:26,590 --> 00:07:28,510
I wouldn't be able to survive.

104
00:07:30,320 --> 00:07:32,080
The puppet from earlier

105
00:07:32,430 --> 00:07:33,910
was incredibly strong

106
00:07:34,230 --> 00:07:36,390
and looks extremely sturdy as well.

107
00:07:36,870 --> 00:07:38,950
If he refines my physical body,

108
00:07:40,190 --> 00:07:42,390
it should be able to last 3000 years, right ?

109
00:08:00,790 --> 00:08:03,490
The thunder energy of these three has the same origin.

110
00:08:03,350 --> 00:08:06,590
They're perfect for refining a Celestial Guard.

111
00:08:08,630 --> 00:08:10,440
If I do my best to cooperate,

112
00:08:11,350 --> 00:08:13,560
he should be able to successfully refine me.

113
00:08:14,030 --> 00:08:15,230
My Origin Soul

114
00:08:15,550 --> 00:08:17,550
will only survive if he succeeds !

115
00:08:23,230 --> 00:08:26,120
6 months later

116
00:08:29,950 --> 00:08:30,880
This is bad !

117
00:08:54,310 --> 00:08:55,510
It failed...

118
00:08:56,150 --> 00:08:57,710
The Origin Soul dissipated...

119
00:08:58,390 --> 00:08:59,750
Since that's the case,

120
00:09:00,030 --> 00:09:02,630
this Celestial Guard won't be able to use any spells at all.

121
00:09:06,510 --> 00:09:09,830
I thought that with an Illusory Yin body and Thunder Beast essence blood,

122
00:09:10,470 --> 00:09:12,870
it would be enough to refine a mid-grade Celestial Guard.

123
00:09:14,430 --> 00:09:15,710
Looking at it now,

124
00:09:15,510 --> 00:09:17,310
raising a Celestial Guard's grade

125
00:09:18,190 --> 00:09:20,070
is very unlikely.

126
00:09:21,950 --> 00:09:22,710
Oh well...

127
00:09:23,430 --> 00:09:25,510
At least I didn't lose everything.

128
00:09:25,670 --> 00:09:27,910
This body has reached the peak of silver-grade

129
00:09:28,070 --> 00:09:29,310
and is intact.

130
00:09:30,470 --> 00:09:33,030
When my Origin Soul is able to leave my body once again,

131
00:09:33,710 --> 00:09:35,510
I might be able to control it.

132
00:09:45,150 --> 00:09:47,070
A jade from the Thunder Celestial Temple ?

133
00:09:50,390 --> 00:09:52,080
Such a powerful thunder barrier...

134
00:10:07,750 --> 00:10:09,470
Furnace Becomes the World ?

135
00:10:10,750 --> 00:10:12,550
Use your own Dao to create a cauldron,

136
00:10:13,350 --> 00:10:14,960
and refine the world with it.

137
00:10:17,270 --> 00:10:18,190
Unfortunately,

138
00:10:18,630 --> 00:10:21,230
this spell requires too much origin energy.

139
00:10:21,750 --> 00:10:23,230
I can't use it before

140
00:10:23,550 --> 00:10:24,870
I reach Illusory Yin.

141
00:10:25,590 --> 00:10:28,760
Thunder Origin Spell

142
00:10:29,270 --> 00:10:30,830
Absorb origin energy from thunder

143
00:10:31,430 --> 00:10:33,070
and quickly condense it into your own.

144
00:10:34,110 --> 00:10:35,550
It will reduce the time

145
00:10:35,870 --> 00:10:37,550
one stays at the Yin and Yang realms...

146
00:10:39,750 --> 00:10:41,510
It can actually condense the thunder

147
00:10:41,710 --> 00:10:43,630
into origin energy for cultivation !

148
00:10:44,870 --> 00:10:46,270
With the help of this spell,

149
00:10:46,550 --> 00:10:48,310
I will be able to reduce the time

150
00:10:49,030 --> 00:10:50,790
it will take for me to reach the second step.

151
00:10:52,150 --> 00:10:53,910
This Thunder Origin Spell is so powerful

152
00:10:54,550 --> 00:10:56,160
that without a thunder body,

153
00:10:56,510 --> 00:10:57,790
cultivating it

154
00:10:57,870 --> 00:10:59,550
would be the same as digging your grave.

155
00:10:59,910 --> 00:11:02,390
No wonder the Thunder Celestial Temple monopolizes it

156
00:11:02,990 --> 00:11:05,510
and rules the Allheaven Star System.

157
00:11:06,990 --> 00:11:09,390
Now that I have a Thunder Celestial Temple token,

158
00:11:10,350 --> 00:11:13,150
even if a real Thunder Celestial Messenger were to encounter me,

159
00:11:13,830 --> 00:11:16,190
they wouldn't be able to see through me.

160
00:11:18,150 --> 00:11:19,590
He was just a messenger,

161
00:11:19,950 --> 00:11:21,910
but he was incredibly wealthy...

162
00:11:23,630 --> 00:11:25,270
The Thunder Celestial Temple

163
00:11:25,870 --> 00:11:27,590
is truly unfathomable.

164
00:11:28,430 --> 00:11:30,510
With these celestial jades,

165
00:11:31,110 --> 00:11:32,870
Late stage Ascendant

166
00:11:33,390 --> 00:11:34,470
is within reach !

167
00:11:45,950 --> 00:11:49,240
6 months later

168
00:12:13,790 --> 00:12:16,280
Wang Lin's avatar
Late stage Ascendant

169
00:12:17,150 --> 00:12:18,590
My cultivation has stabilized.

170
00:12:19,230 --> 00:12:21,830
It's time to probe the secret of the Moongazer Serpent once more.

171
00:12:23,230 --> 00:12:25,670
The flame metal vein is crucial to completing the Heaven Defying Bead.

172
00:12:26,270 --> 00:12:28,110
Even if it's a bone of the Moongazer Serpent,

173
00:12:28,990 --> 00:12:30,830
I am determined to obtain it.

174
00:12:32,510 --> 00:12:35,830
Planet Yun Xia is actually a sleeping Moongazer Serpent.

175
00:12:36,950 --> 00:12:39,150
If the beast wakes up while I am extracting its bone,

176
00:12:39,630 --> 00:12:41,110
I won't survive.

177
00:12:42,790 --> 00:12:44,150
For this mission to succeed,

178
00:12:44,390 --> 00:12:46,500
I need a huge number of Celestial Ascension Fruits

179
00:12:45,990 --> 00:12:48,240
Planet
Thousand
Illusions

180
00:12:46,550 --> 00:12:48,110
to temporarily paralyze it.

181
00:12:47,990 --> 00:12:50,640
half a month later

182
00:12:59,270 --> 00:13:02,430
I wonder which messenger has graced our humble planet.

183
00:13:02,590 --> 00:13:05,030
The entire Huan Family has failed to welcome you properly,

184
00:13:05,110 --> 00:13:06,630
please forgive our manners.

185
00:13:07,590 --> 00:13:08,910
Head of the Huan Family,

186
00:13:09,630 --> 00:13:11,070
come up.

187
00:13:11,350 --> 00:13:12,310
This voice...

188
00:13:12,670 --> 00:13:13,630
It's him !

189
00:13:14,870 --> 00:13:16,990
Huan Fengshen, Head of the Huan Family,

190
00:13:16,990 --> 00:13:18,630
pays respects to Lord Messenger.

191
00:13:18,910 --> 00:13:19,830
Earlier,

192
00:13:20,270 --> 00:13:21,670
we didn't know your identity

193
00:13:21,630 --> 00:13:22,670
and have offended you.

194
00:13:22,790 --> 00:13:24,830
I hope Lord Messenger can forgive us.

195
00:13:25,910 --> 00:13:27,430
He came this time

196
00:13:27,790 --> 00:13:29,630
to settle the score...

197
00:13:30,270 --> 00:13:31,870
The reason I have come this time,

198
00:13:32,350 --> 00:13:34,910
is to take your Huan Family's Celestial Ascension Fruits.

199
00:13:35,710 --> 00:13:36,710
Lord Messenger,

200
00:13:36,910 --> 00:13:38,110
those Celestial Ascension Fruits

201
00:13:38,110 --> 00:13:40,190
are crucial for our Huan Family to enter

202
00:13:40,070 --> 00:13:41,960
the Thunder Celestial Realm in 100 years !

203
00:13:41,070 --> 00:13:41,960
Shut up !

204
00:13:46,710 --> 00:13:47,870
Lord Messenger,

205
00:13:48,150 --> 00:13:49,230
our Huan Family

206
00:13:49,910 --> 00:13:53,470
is willing to give up our qualification to enter the Thunder Celestial Realm in 100 years

207
00:13:54,790 --> 00:13:56,280
Celestial Ascension Fruits

208
00:13:54,550 --> 00:13:56,280
and offer our Celestial Ascension Fruits

209
00:13:56,030 --> 00:13:57,950
are related to the Thunder Celestial Realm ?

210
00:13:56,030 --> 00:13:57,950
to show our dedication to you, Lord Messenger !

211
00:13:57,710 --> 00:13:58,910
We just want to ask you

212
00:13:59,470 --> 00:14:01,030
to forget our old grudges.

213
00:14:01,270 --> 00:14:02,320
Agreed.

214
00:14:08,630 --> 00:14:09,790
Lord Messenger,

215
00:14:10,110 --> 00:14:11,270
they're all here.

216
00:14:22,950 --> 00:14:25,630
We bid farewell to Lord Messenger !

217
00:14:27,430 --> 00:14:29,750
This Thunder Celestial Messenger identity

218
00:14:30,350 --> 00:14:31,510
is quite useful.

219
00:14:33,350 --> 00:14:35,150
Looks like I can use this as an excuse

220
00:14:35,510 --> 00:14:37,110
in the Northern Domain of Allheaven

221
00:14:37,550 --> 00:14:38,990
to do what I want.

222
00:14:39,750 --> 00:14:43,080
Qian Family's Ancestral Home
Planet Thousand Illusions

223
00:14:42,150 --> 00:14:43,470
Qian Kuizi of the Qian Family,

224
00:14:43,630 --> 00:14:44,870
pays respects to Messenger Xu.

225
00:14:44,710 --> 00:14:46,390
We pay respects to Messenger Xu.

226
00:14:46,430 --> 00:14:47,870
Senior Qian Kuizi,

227
00:14:48,470 --> 00:14:49,630
long time no see.

228
00:14:50,550 --> 00:14:52,280
I don't dare to call myself your Senior,

229
00:14:52,030 --> 00:14:53,110
you flatter me.

230
00:14:54,070 --> 00:14:56,550
I heard that you are looking for Celestial Ascension Fruits.

231
00:14:57,150 --> 00:14:58,830
Our Qian Family has prepared a small gift

232
00:14:58,870 --> 00:15:01,390
that we wish to present to you as a token of our appreciation.

233
00:15:03,110 --> 00:15:04,950
He is well-informed

234
00:15:05,550 --> 00:15:07,390
and is putting on this show...

235
00:15:08,630 --> 00:15:10,750
He really is an old fox.

236
00:15:12,590 --> 00:15:14,040
Lord Messenger, wait a moment.

237
00:15:15,630 --> 00:15:16,790
I humbly ask you

238
00:15:16,910 --> 00:15:18,150
to please show us

239
00:15:18,110 --> 00:15:20,310
your Thunder Celestial Temple token

240
00:15:20,390 --> 00:15:22,350
to let us witness its divine might.

241
00:15:24,710 --> 00:15:26,960
Senior, you don't trust me ?

242
00:15:29,350 --> 00:15:30,510
I wouldn't dare.

243
00:15:31,350 --> 00:15:32,510
In Allheaven,

244
00:15:32,470 --> 00:15:35,270
who doesn't know that there are only 99 Thunder Celestial Messengers ?

245
00:15:35,510 --> 00:15:36,670
Their status

246
00:15:36,790 --> 00:15:37,990
is sky high.

247
00:15:38,550 --> 00:15:41,110
How would I dare to offend one ?

248
00:15:45,030 --> 00:15:46,550
The Thunder Celestial Temple token

249
00:15:46,590 --> 00:15:48,190
can't be counterfeited.

250
00:15:48,790 --> 00:15:50,750
It's been less than 100 years

251
00:15:50,910 --> 00:15:52,870
and he has already reached Late stage Ascendant.

252
00:15:53,790 --> 00:15:54,750
Perhaps...

253
00:15:55,350 --> 00:15:57,150
I should bet on him early.

254
00:16:05,430 --> 00:16:06,390
There's one more thing

255
00:16:06,790 --> 00:16:08,790
that I need to ask Messenger Xu.

256
00:16:08,990 --> 00:16:09,790
Speak.

257
00:16:10,750 --> 00:16:12,030
Thunder Celestial Messengers

258
00:16:12,390 --> 00:16:14,590
all have subordinate families.

259
00:16:15,350 --> 00:16:16,510
If you're willing,

260
00:16:16,950 --> 00:16:18,950
I can promise on my Dao

261
00:16:19,590 --> 00:16:21,590
that when you reach Illusory Yin,

262
00:16:21,910 --> 00:16:24,750
our Qian Family will become your subordinates.

263
00:16:25,670 --> 00:16:27,190
Thunder Celestial Messengers

264
00:16:27,830 --> 00:16:31,070
can actually develop their own affiliated forces ?

265
00:16:32,910 --> 00:16:35,630
If my true identity is exposed, it will backfire on me.

266
00:16:36,470 --> 00:16:38,790
If that happens, I won't be able to protect them

267
00:16:39,310 --> 00:16:41,190
and it would destroy their family.

268
00:16:41,830 --> 00:16:43,270
I can't accept

269
00:16:44,030 --> 00:16:45,270
this karma.

270
00:16:47,190 --> 00:16:48,230
I appreciate

271
00:16:48,230 --> 00:16:49,190
your kind offer.

272
00:16:49,910 --> 00:16:51,150
Let's drop this matter.

273
00:16:56,710 --> 00:16:58,990
It must be because of what happened with Huan Wuqing...

274
00:16:59,190 --> 00:17:00,630
He still holds a grudge against me

275
00:17:01,070 --> 00:17:03,270
and I probed him even more today.

276
00:17:06,270 --> 00:17:07,550
What a pity...

277
00:17:09,270 --> 00:17:10,790
This messenger title

278
00:17:11,190 --> 00:17:12,710
is a bit too grand.

279
00:17:15,510 --> 00:17:16,390
Oh well...

280
00:17:16,910 --> 00:17:18,480
As long as it's useful.

281
00:17:32,110 --> 00:17:33,240
